<title>MALAYSIA: Kumpulan Guthrie awarded road project.</title>
<headline>Kumpulan Guthrie awarded road project.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian construction and plantations firm Kumpulan Guthrie Bhd said the government has in principle agreed to let it develop the Kuala Lumpur outer ring road.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the Economic Planning Unit in the Prime Minister's department had given the clearance for the project, but it did not give any details.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
